## 截图历史窗口：列表、操作、确认框与提示。

history-window-title = 截图历史

history-count = 共 { $arg1 } 条

history-page-indicator = 第 { $arg1 } / { $arg2 } 页

history-prev = 上一页

history-next = 下一页

history-empty-title = 还没有截图历史

history-empty-hint = 复制、保存或贴图的截图会出现在这里。

history-disabled-hint = 记录已关闭。在设置中开启“截图历史”后才会保留新的截图。

history-source-copied = 已复制到剪贴板

history-source-saved = 已保存为文件

history-source-pinned = 已贴到屏幕

history-source-monitor = 当前显示器

history-source-window = 前台窗口

history-size = { $arg1 } x { $arg2 } 像素

history-thumb-loading = 预览加载中...

history-action-copy = 复制

history-action-pin = 贴图

history-action-locate = 在文件夹中显示

history-action-delete = 删除

history-action-clear = 清空全部

history-delete-title = 删除这张截图？

history-delete-desc = 此操作无法撤销。

history-clear-title = 清空全部截图历史？

history-clear-desc = 这会永久删除所有已保存的截图历史。

history-confirm-delete = 删除

history-confirm-cancel = 取消

history-notice-copied = 已复制到剪贴板。

history-notice-copy-failed = 复制失败：{ $arg1 }

history-notice-pinned = 已贴到屏幕。

history-notice-pin-failed = 贴图失败：{ $arg1 }

history-notice-locate-failed = 无法打开文件夹：{ $arg1 }

history-notice-delete-failed = 删除失败：{ $arg1 }
